  "setup": "Dense 1B with dynamic document repacking. All three warmdown chains branch only from pre-decay checkpoints. The fixed-coordinate chain uses LR 1e-3 / WD 0.333 throughout; the best-coordinate chain uses (5e-4, 0.333) at BS1024, (1e-3, 0.333) at BS256, and (1e-3, 0.3) at BS64. Version 2 stays at BS1024 through E4, then uses BS256 through E8 and BS64 from E8 onward.",
